  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MoUs and service-level agreements (ODA CDEL &amp; RDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SECE will establish MoUs and service-level agreements with key cross-governmental partners. These will enable synergies across Government Departments and maximise efficiency through using existing Government capability, and allow the programme to draw on advice at higher security tiers. This project will cover the ODA spend</narrative>
  </description>
